- **Half-screen constraint**: both A/B arms share listed threads/affinity; this is NOT an effect from changing those settings. Source-only, not runtime treatment.
- **Historical (non-transfer)**: `akm-glm53-iqk-expert-multirow` measured null for expert-row batching on GLM; `akm-glm53-q8-rowexact-batch` measured null for dense Q8 batching. Different models, stale epoch.

